s_at 11:41:19Z`, heartbeat stopped at 11:36:22.84. Lease expiry is separate from the signed deadline and does not consume rounds.\n- **Initiative:** `managed` is compiled; accepted tasks 0/1; capability `LEG-POLICY-SCHEMA-VALID` is **unproven** (gap: integration proof task missing). Task `T-20260914-chat-output` remains `ready`, sealed (`signed_off: true`), `accepted: false`.\n\nSo the stop is a repairable blocker with budget left, not exhaustion — no successor work is warranted on the evidence.\n\n## What I did and did not do\n\nInspection was read-only: CLI views with `mutation: none` (`status --initiative`, `status <task>`, `graph --initiative`) plus existing artifacts and a read-only SQLite connection to the existing mesh database. I deliberately avoided `taskspec mesh status <attempt>` (the suggested `NEXT`) because on initialized runtime its contract allows restarting the daemon.\n\nPer your instruction, I did **not** reset the budget, authorize a successor, or resume execution. The blocker to resolve before any future resume is the failing adapter executable; resuming would not refund the used round or restart the 12:06:21Z deadline."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":808,"cache_read_input_tokens":31770,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":808},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d3aa1c2a-a122-478d-932c-2947f83b95ec","uuid":"c140bddc-6611-4418-a176-6b584ed95960","timestamp":"2026-09-15T11:38:13.716Z","request_id":"req_011Cf5A9ybr4bW1jBPSUhMwy"}
